  "title": "Hiker missing 1 week in National Park, Coast Guard hoists to safety",
  "description": "An MH-65 Dolphin helicopter crew from Coast Guard Air Station Port Angeles assisted local responders, July 23, 2017, in medically evacuating a 71-year-old female hiker who reportedly went missing a week ago in the Olympic National Park. The hiker, who reportedly suffered from dehydration and fatigue, was safely transferred to awaiting medical personnel at the Olympic Medical Center in Port Angeles, Washington.",
